message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Note: this citation covers the Samudra Manthanam software only.
  The corpus texts (Sanskrit sources and Russian translations) carry
  their own rights and must be cited by their print editions.
type: software
title: "Samudra Manthanam — parallel Sanskrit–Russian corpus search"
abstract: >-
  Search platform for a parallel Sanskrit–Russian text corpus:
  full-text, regex, and stem/root search with a scholarly reader,
  developed by the Society of Sanskrit Enthusiasts (samskrtam.ru).
authors:
